Morthal — City Profile
Pillar 1: Structure
Name & High Concept: Morthal — a small hold in a cold marsh (living-
world.md, Hjaalmarch section, verbatim).
Atmosphere & Core Conflict: A town that has been quietly hollowing out
for months and doesn't have the words for what it's watching happen to
itself. Living-world.md, verbatim: "Vacant-eyed townspeople who don't
remember certain nights. A Jarl who speaks in oblique terms about
something ancient and patient moving through her hold... This describes
both vampire predation and the early stages of Ismara's work in a hold.
The party will hear this as a description of Ismara. They are both right
and wrong." Small enough that everyone genuinely knows everyone, which is
exactly why nobody has caught what's happening yet — familiarity reads
as safety here.
